# Git commits

Never add this trailer (or any Cursor/AI co-author trailer) to commits:

```
--trailer "Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>"
```

Do not add `Co-authored-by: Cursor …` by any other means either. Commits are authored only as the user/repo configured identity.
